The following zeroshot_phenotype-*.ipynb contain feature extraction of images and molecular structure. 
    They differ in which images they use for extract the features.
    1. ALLdata : full images
    2. All500p : full images that we resized to 500x500 resolution using box mean averaging
    3. CROPsingle       : crops of 600x600 taken in the middle of full resolution image (position 2-1 in the 4x4 grid)
    4. CROPsingle_top10 : again crops 600x600 but now only top 10 compounds (from full resolution images) + dmso are considered
